ss=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/527340/extras/d2dacb23924e1012c1d6394b887aaee6.webp?t=1550540742\" width=712 height=40 /></span><br>Classic timed team deathmatch mode! You and your teammates have 5 minutes to find and kill as many player boxes as possible, by the end of the match the team with most kills wins!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/527340/extras/8cbcd30b58a223fe6a5ea479f18fddb9.webp?t=1550540742\" width=712 height=40 /></span><br>Your team must retrieve the opposing team's packing tape and return it to your team's base! The team that retrieves the most tape by the end of the match wins.​",
